 "sections": [
  {
   "heading": "Overview",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "kind": "p",
     "text": "The Starter fleets are a selection of fleets that come already pre-installed on your files on download of the game in their respective OSP and ANS folders. They are curated by selected community members as a way to give newer players a frame of reference for what the average 3000 point fleet looks like."
    },
    {
     "kind": "p",
     "text": "Keep in mind that all of the starter fleets are held to a certain standard and have to uphold certain requirements, meaning they cannot be fully optimized or take compromises in order to make them beginner-freindly. They are not designed to be meta or high end by most regards, but BY THEMSELVES serve well enough to be used in the standard multiplayer match."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "heading": "ANS",
   "blocks": []
  },
  {
   "heading": "ANS › TF Oak",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "kind": "p",
     "text": "Frontline Fleet: Dual Axford Heavy Cruisers optimized for winning gunfights against other heavy frontline assets."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "heading": "ANS › TF Birch",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "kind": "p",
     "text": "Frontline Fleet: Double Vauxhall Light Cruisers with high-end missile backpacks and Sprinter EWAR Corvette."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "heading": "ANS › TF Hemlock",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "kind": "p",
     "text": "Backline Fleet: Solo Axford Missile Cruiser."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "heading": "ANS › TF Redwood",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "kind": "p",
     "text": "Frontline Fleet: 4TC Axford Heavy Cruiser backed up by dual Keystone Rail Destroyers and Sprinter Lockvette."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "heading": "ANS › TF Ash",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "kind": "p",
     "text": "Ambush Fleet: Triple Keystone Beam Destroyer Array and an Sprinter EWAR Corvette."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "heading": "ANS › TF Sycamore",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "kind": "p",
     "text": "Backline Fleet: Five ship Sprinter Bomber formation."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "heading": "ANS › TF Maple",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "kind": "p",
     "text": "Backline Fleet: Solo Levy Escort Carrier backed up by dual Air Defense Raines Frigates."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "heading": "ANS › TF Willow",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "kind": "p",
     "text": "Cap fleet: Three Keystone Beam Destroyers, Two Sprinter ELINT Corvettes, Three Capping Sprinters."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "heading": "OSP",
   "blocks": []
  },
  {
   "heading": "OSP › Cobalt Squadron",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "kind": "p",
     "text": "Frontline Fleet: Dual Ocello Command Cruisers optimized for winning gunfights against other heavy frontline assets."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "heading": "OSP › Garnet Squadron",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "kind": "p",
     "text": "Frontline Fleet: Five ship Flathead Monitor formation optimized for fighting in plasma range and zoning ANS skirmish assets with bomb shell."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "heading": "OSP › Kyanite Squadron",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "kind": "p",
     "text": "Frontline Fleet: Dual Marauder Line Ships optimized for winning gunfights against other heavy frontline assets and One LRT Draugr Tug"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "heading": "OSP › Zircon Squadron",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "kind": "p",
     "text": "Ambush Fleet: Dual Marauder Line Ships optimized for fighting in plasma range and One Sensor Draugr Tug"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "heading": "OSP › Azurite Squadron",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "kind": "p",
     "text": "Ambush Fleet: Solo Torpedo Cruiser backed up by One Sensor Draugr Tug and Two Rocket Shuttles."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "heading": "OSP › Amethyst Squadron",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "kind": "p",
     "text": "Backline Fleet: Solo Moorline Carrier."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "heading": "OSP › Wulfenite Squadron",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "kind": "p",
     "text": "Cap Fleet: Two Journeyman Light Carriers and Three Capping Ferryman Shuttles."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "heading": "OSP › Tantalum Squadron",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "kind": "p",
     "text": "Cap Fleet: Tantalum is designed to engage in scout warfare. Scouting and killing scouts with a dispersed network of Draugr Multi-Mission Tugs and Ferryman Shuttles while utilizing a Flathead Monitor as a cruise missile platform against isolated targets of opportunity."
    }
   ]
  },
